<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>小熊玩偶的奇幻世界</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- 导航栏 -->
    <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">主页</a></li>
            <li><a href="#story">小熊日记</a></li>
            <li><a href="#game">互动游戏</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- 主页 -->
    <section id="home" class="page active">
        <h1>欢迎来到小熊的森林🌲</h1>
        <div class="photo-wall">
            <img src="bear1.jpg" alt="小熊在树下">
            <img src="bear2.jpg" alt="小熊抱蜂蜜">
            <img src="bear3.jpg" alt="小熊和朋友">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 故事页 -->
    <section id="story" class="page">
        <h2>小熊的冒险日记📖</h2>
        <div class="diary">
            <article>
                <h3>第一天：遇见蜜蜂朋友</h3>
                <p>今天在橡树旁发现了一个巨大的蜂巢...</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h3>第五天：彩虹桥的秘密</h3>
                <p>跟着蝴蝶穿过蘑菇圈，竟然看到了...</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 游戏页 -->
    <section id="game" class="page">
        <h2>帮小熊收集蜂蜜🍯</h2>
        <div id="honey-game">
            <div id="honey-counter">蜂蜜：0/10</div>
            <button onclick="collectHoney()">点击收集</button>
        </div>
    </section>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>